Complete other waterproofing specification areas

Fictional test correspondence. All people, addresses, decisions and project particulars in this document are invented for a software evaluation.

Record R410 Date 2026-11-13 Email reply

From: Fictional Quantity Surveyor <qs@consense-scenario.invalid>
To: Fictional Coordination Team <team@consense-scenario.invalid>

The following nine items are the complete specification areas covered by the other waterproofing installation warranty for this contract. Include every listed area and its stated extent.

1. Housing kitchens and utility rooms, including floor gullies, pipe penetrations and the upstands behind fixed cabinets;
2. Housing bathrooms, toilets and shower rooms, including door thresholds, shower kerbs and wall to floor junctions;
3. School changing rooms and showers, including the accessible shower bay and the drainage channels beneath the benches;
4. Refuse storage rooms and material recovery rooms, including wash down floors, drain collars and wet wall surfaces;
5. School catering kitchens and washing areas, including grease trap access covers and service trench junctions;
6. Underground fresh water and flushing water tanks, including tank walls, bases, construction joints and access necks;
7. Basement retaining walls around the housing car park, including wall sleeves and the junction with the basement slab;
8. Landscape planters above the covered walkway, including root resistant protection, irrigation sleeves and overflow outlets;
9. School playground drainage sumps and connecting channels, including cover frames and movement joints at the channel ends.

Regards,
Fictional Quantity Surveyor

